# Invoicing System — Clean-Slate Design

## Platform Context

Enforcer is an API marketplace. **Consumers** subscribe to plans. An invoice is generated when a consumer owes money.

Two payment flows exist:

| Flow | When | How |
|---|---|---|
| **Checkout** | New subscription | Consumer previews the invoice, decides to pay or go back |
| **Direct Charge** | Renewal, Plan Switch | Automated charge using saved card — no UI |

---

## The Core Insight: Don't Save Until Paid

During checkout, the consumer is **browsing**. They see what they'll owe, and they might go back. Saving an invoice to the database at this stage creates garbage — orphaned `Pending` invoices for every abandoned checkout.

**Rule: An invoice is only persisted when payment is confirmed.**

---

## Checkout Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Consumer
    participant API
    participant Factory as InvoiceFactory
    participant Stripe
    participant Webhook

    Consumer->>API: "I want to subscribe to Plan X"
    API->>API: Validate promo, check wallet
    API->>Factory: ForSubscription(...) → in-memory Invoice
    Factory-->>API: Invoice (NOT saved)
    API->>Stripe: CreateCheckoutSession(line items, metadata)
    Note over Stripe: metadata = { planId, consumerId, discount, credit }
    Stripe-->>Consumer: Checkout page (preview)

    alt Consumer pays
        Stripe->>Webhook: PaymentIntent.Succeeded
        Webhook->>Factory: ForSubscription(...) → rebuild from metadata
        Webhook->>Webhook: invoice.Pay() → save to DB
    else Consumer goes back
        Note over Consumer: Nothing saved. No cleanup needed.
    end
```

The invoice object is created **twice**: once for the checkout preview (discarded if abandoned), and once in the webhook when payment succeeds (persisted). The factory is deterministic, so both produce identical results.

## Direct Charge Flow (Renewal / Plan Switch)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Job as Background Job / Service
    participant Factory as InvoiceFactory
    participant Stripe
    participant DB

    Job->>Factory: ForRenewal(...) or ForPlanSwitch(...)
    Factory-->>Job: Invoice (in-memory)
    Job->>Stripe: ChargeAsync(invoice)
    alt Charge succeeds
        Job->>Job: invoice.Pay()
        Job->>DB: Save invoice
    else Charge fails
        Note over Job: Invoice not saved. Log the failure.
    end
```

No orphaned invoices. If the charge fails, the invoice is never persisted.

---

## 1. Domain — Invoice Aggregate

### Invoice Entity

```csharp
public sealed class Invoice : Entity
{
    public Guid ConsumerId { get; private set; }
    public Guid? SubscriptionId { get; private set; }
    public string InvoiceNumber { get; private set; }
    public string Currency { get; private set; }

    public long Subtotal { get; private set; }
    public long DiscountTotal { get; private set; }
    public long Total { get; private set; }

    public DateTime? PeriodStart { get; private set; }
    public DateTime? PeriodEnd { get; private set; }

    public InvoiceStatus Status { get; private set; }
    public DateTime IssuedAt { get; private set; }
    public DateTime? PaidAt { get; private set; }
    public int PaymentAttempts { get; private set; }
    public string? Notes { get; private set; }

    private readonly List<LineItem> _lineItems;
    public IReadOnlyList<LineItem> LineItems => _lineItems;
}
```

### Construction

`internal static Create(...)` — requires at least one line item. No public [AddLineItem](file:///c:/Users/Mhamed/source/repos/Backend%20Projects/enforcer/backend/src/Modules/Billings/Enforcer.Modules.Billings.Domain/Invoices/Invoice.cs#62-72).

### Lifecycle

```csharp
public Result Pay() { ... }               // Pending → Paid
public Result Void() { ... }              // Pending → Void
public Result Refund(long amount) { ... } // Paid → Refunded | PartiallyRefunded
public void RecordFailedAttempt() => PaymentAttempts++;
public void AssociateSubscription(Guid subscriptionId) { ... } // one-time link
```

### LineItem, Enums, Errors

Same as previous revision — [LineItem](file:///c:/Users/Mhamed/source/repos/Backend%20Projects/enforcer/backend/src/Modules/Billings/Enforcer.Modules.Billings.Domain/Invoices/Invoice.cs#62-72), `LineItemType`, `InvoiceStatus` (Pending, Paid, Void, Refunded, PartiallyRefunded), `InvoiceErrors`.

