## 2. Infrastructure — InvoiceFactory

```csharp
internal static class InvoiceFactory
{
    public static Invoice ForSubscription(
        Guid consumerId, PlanResponse plan, DateTime? expiresAt,
        long discountAmount = 0, string? discountDescription = null,
        long walletCreditUsed = 0) { ... }

    public static Invoice ForRenewal(SubscriptionResponse subscription) { ... }

    public static Invoice ForPlanSwitch(
        SubscriptionResponse subscription,
        PlanResponse targetPlan, DateTime now) { ... }
}
```

---

## 3. File Structure

```
Domain/Invoices/
    Invoice.cs, InvoiceStatus.cs, InvoiceErrors.cs,
    LineItem.cs, LineItemType.cs

Infrastructure/Invoicing/
    InvoiceFactory.cs, InvoiceRepository.cs
```

---

## 4. Summary of Key Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| Don't save on checkout | Consumer might go back. No orphaned invoices |
| Rebuild invoice in webhook | Factory is deterministic — same inputs = same invoice |
| Save only on payment confirmation | Invoice = financial record of a completed transaction |
| No [AddLineItem](file:///c:/Users/Mhamed/source/repos/Backend%20Projects/enforcer/backend/src/Modules/Billings/Enforcer.Modules.Billings.Domain/Invoices/Invoice.cs#62-72) | All line items computed upfront, invoice born complete |
| `Void()` instead of delete | Never delete financial records, just void them |
